.nf
YASMV manual                                                 watch

.ti 0
SYNOPSIS

.in 3
watch set <name> <expression>
watch list

.ti 0
DESCRIPTION

.fi
.in 3
Save an expression to evaluate on workspace worker traces. Watch values
are included in job evidence, available through job show -full.

Requires a loaded model. set saves a new immutable revision; reusing a name
replaces its expression in that revision. list displays the saved expressions.
Names containing spaces must be quoted. Expressions use native syntax and are
validated when used. These commands preserve the native model and trace.

.ti 0
EXAMPLES

.nf
.in 3
>> watch set executions executions
>> watch list

.ti 0
SEE ALSO

.fi
.in 3
help workspace, help job, help reach.
